+-encoded /shape-roadmap's write scope by construction — it only ever wrote `_spine.yaml`, and only
+-the slices' plan fields. Under direct-model-write that same file-level scope is the
+-`scoped_write_guard.py` policy: the spine is the ONLY model file /shape-roadmap may change, so its
+-scope is a single `--allow`:
