----
-name: check-abstraction-layer
-description: Scan product-stage artifacts (research/, specification/, scope/) for abstraction-layer deny-list tokens — specific database engines, SDK method names, framework identifiers, programming-language type signatures, wire-level protocol identifiers, cryptographic constructions, and model version strings. Deterministic grep-based linter. Called by any producer skill (derive-capability-selection, enrich-capabilities, generate-intent-epics, recommend-mvp) after writing an artifact, and as a close-phase check by the specify play.
